0result.sql uses only finalised sales (status ‘Complete’ or ‘Shipped’), limits the data to orders created before 2023‑01‑01, derives each shopper’s first‑purchase month, calculates month offsets 0‑3, and divides the distinct‑buyer counts by the true cohort size.  
The other two queries either treat ‘Returned/Processing’ items as purchases or derive the first month as offset 1, which makes their percentages inconsistent with the stated requirement.  

